<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Action Required: Welcome to {!Community_Name}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f6f9; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#1f1f1f;">
    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color:#f4f6f9; margin:0; padding:24px 0;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="640" style="width:640px; max-width:640px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:24px 32px 16px 32px; background-color:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">
                            <img
                                src="https://solink--atdev.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015G100000AlqAHIAZ&amp;oid=00DG100000A9TmbMAF"
                                alt="Solink"
                                style="display:block; max-width:180px; height:auto; border:0;"
                            />
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:32px;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:16px; line-height:24px;">
                                Dear {!Receiving_User.FirstName},
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:16px; line-height:24px;">
Welcome to your secure customer portal! This platform allows you to manage your site details and gives you real time access to all deployment updates including tracking information. 
                            </p>

                            <div style="margin:24px 0; padding:20px 24px; background-color:#eef4ff; border-left:4px solid #0176d3; border-radius:4px;">
                                <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:22px; font-weight:bold; color:#014486;">
                                    Your Login Details
                                </p>
                                <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:22px;">
                                    <strong>Username:</strong> {!Receiving_User.Username}
                                </p>
                                <p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:22px;">
                                    To get started, go to
                                    <a href="{!Community_Url}" style="color:#0176d3; text-decoration:none;">{!Community_Url}</a>
                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:16px; line-height:24px;">                             
  If you have any questions or need assistance accessing the portal, please reach out to our support team at https://solink.com/contact-us/

                            </p>

                            <p style="margin:24px 0 0 0; font-size:16px; line-height:24px;">
                                Best regards,
                                <br />
                              The Solink Operations Team
                                <br />
                                {!Organization.Name}
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>